<h2>Setting Template Requirements</h2>

<p>
    Some templates need specific information to work correctly. For example, a renewal reminder template needs to know which policy you're talking about. You can mark these requirements in the template settings:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Requires Policy</strong> – The template needs a policy to fill in policy-related variables</li>
    <li><strong>Requires Contact</strong> – The template needs a contact to fill in contact-related variables</li>
    <li><strong>Requires Payment</strong> – The template needs a payment amount</li>
    <li><strong>Requires Down Payment</strong> – The template needs a down payment amount</li>
</ul>

<p>
    When you try to use a template, Quickfire will prompt you for any missing required information before sending. This prevents sending incomplete emails.
</p>

