<h2>Activating Templates</h2>

<p>
    Templates can be active or inactive:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Active templates</strong> – Appear in dropdown menus and can be used</li>
    <li><strong>Inactive templates</strong> – Saved but hidden from menus (useful for old templates you might want to reuse later)</li>
</ul>

<p>
    When you create or edit a template, you can activate it immediately or save it as inactive. You can change this status anytime—deactivating a template doesn't delete it, it just hides it from selection menus.
</p>

