<h2>Using Templates</h2>

<p>
    Templates can be used in several ways:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>From agents</strong> – Custom agents can use templates to send automated emails</li>
    <li><strong>From action buttons</strong> – Buttons on client or renewal pages can trigger template emails</li>
    <li><strong>From template picker</strong> – Select a template manually when you need to send an email</li>
</ul>

<p>
    No matter how you use them, the process is the same: select the template, provide any required information, and Outlook opens with the email ready to send.
</p>

